- **Name:** [Your project name]
- **Description:** [One-line description]

## Tech Stack
- **Framework:** [Next.js / React SPA + Vite / etc.]
- **UI Library:** [shadcn/ui / MUI / etc.]
- **Styling:** [Tailwind CSS / CSS Modules / etc.]
- **Dev Server Port:** [3000 / 5173 / etc.]

## Visual Direction
- **Design System:** `design-system.md` at project root (DESIGN.md format — tokens + prose). If missing, Agent 1 generates it from `design-system.md.template` as the first deliverable. All agents read this as the canonical source for colors, typography, spacing, and components.
- **Visual References:** [Directory path to screenshots/mockups for ad-hoc inspiration, or "N/A". Tokens belong in `design-system.md`, not here.]
- **Key Inspirations:** [e.g. "Linear-style minimal", "Dashboard with sidebar nav" — one-liner only; the *why* lives in the design-system.md prose sections.]

